---
title: Building Ferni - Our Open Build Story
description: The story of how a human and an AI built something beautiful together. No VCs. No roadmaps. Just genuine curiosity and a lot of late nights.
permalink: /building/
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/_tokens.css">
  <title>{{ title }} | Ferni</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ description }}">
  
  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ description }}">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://ferni.ai/building/">
  
  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
  
  <!-- Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       BUILDING FERNI - Complete Standalone Styles
       No external dependencies - everything inline for reliability
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    :root {
      --color-bg-alt: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    }
    
    body { 
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       NAVIGATION
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-paper) 90%, transparent);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 5%, transparent);
    }
    
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color var(--duration-normal);
    }
    
    .nav-links a:hover,
    .nav-links a.active {
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO SECTION
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg) 0%, var(--color-bg-alt) 100%);
      padding: 120px 24px 80px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .hero-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    
    .hero-bg svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
    
    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
    }
    
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ferni) 10%, transparent);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      animation: fadeInUp var(--duration-cinematic) ease-out;
    }
    
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      animation: fadeInUp var(--duration-cinematic) ease-out var(--duration-faster) both;
    }
    
    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-ferni) 0%, var(--color-peter) 50%, var(--color-maya) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      max-width: 550px;
      margin: 0 auto 48px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      animation: fadeInUp var(--duration-cinematic) ease-out var(--duration-normal) both;
    }
    
    .scroll-hint {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      animation: fadeInUp var(--duration-cinematic) ease-out var(--duration-slow) both;
    }
    
    .scroll-hint svg {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 8px;
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    
    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      40% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
      60% { transform: translateY(-4px); }
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ORIGIN STORY
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .origin {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    }
    
    .origin-card {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      padding: 48px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xl);
    }
    
    .quote {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-style: italic;
      padding-left: 24px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-ferni);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    .response {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      padding-top: 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 8%, transparent);
    }
    
    .avatar {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-peter), var(--color-alex));
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-white);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    
    .response-content {
      flex: 1;
    }
    
    .response-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    
    .author-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    .author-role {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       TIMELINE
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .timeline {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--color-bg);
    }
    
    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
    
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    .timeline-track {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }
    
    .timeline-track::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 15px;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--color-ferni), var(--color-peter), var(--color-maya));
      border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    }
    
    .milestone {
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 48px;
    }
    
    .milestone:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    
    .milestone-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -33px;
      top: 4px;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background: var(--color-ferni);
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 3px solid var(--color-bg);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-ferni);
    }
    
    .milestone-dot.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-ferni), var(--color-peter));
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--color-bg), 0 0 0 5px var(--color-ferni);
    }
    
    .milestone-date {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    
    .milestone-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    
    .milestone-text {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    .milestone-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ferni) 10%, transparent);
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    
    .milestone-tag.highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-ferni), var(--color-peter));
      color: var(--color-white);
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       STORIES GRID
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .stories {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    }
    
    .section-sub {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 16px auto 0;
    }
    
    .stories-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .stories-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    
    .story-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: var(--color-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 28px;
      transition: transform var(--duration-slow) ease, box-shadow var(--duration-slow) ease;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    
    .story-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xl);
    }
    
    .story-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    
    .category {
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ferni) 10%, transparent);
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    
    .category.behind-the-scenes { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ferni) 10%, transparent); color: var(--color-ferni-text); }
    .category.failures { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-maya) 10%, transparent); color: var(--color-maya-text); }
    .category.lessons { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-jack) 10%, transparent); color: var(--color-nayan-text); }
    .category.design-philosophy { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-jordan) 10%, transparent); color: var(--color-jordan-text); }
    
    .date {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }
    
    .story-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    .story-card p {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    
    .story-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 6%, transparent);
    }
    
    .story-avatar {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-white);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    
    .story-author {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    .read-more {
      margin-left: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    
    .read-more svg {
      transition: transform var(--duration-normal);
    }
    
    .story-card:hover .read-more svg {
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA SECTION
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .cta {
      padding: 120px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-ferni) 0%, var(--color-peter) 100%);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .cta::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 400 400' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      opacity: 0.03;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    
    .cta-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .cta h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-white);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    
    .cta p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-white) 90%, transparent);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    
    .cta-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all var(--duration-normal) ease;
    }
    
    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-white);
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    }
    
    .btn-primary:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xl);
    }
    
    .btn-secondary {
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-white) 12%, transparent);
      color: var(--color-white);
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-white) 25%, transparent);
    }
    
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-white) 20%, transparent);
      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-white) 40%, transparent);
    }
    
    /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       FOOTER
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    
    .footer {
      padding: 60px 24px 40px;
      background: var(--color-bg);
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 6%, transparent);
    }
    
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    
    .footer-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    
    .footer-links a {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color var(--duration-normal);
    }
    
    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-ferni-text);
    }
    
    .footer-copy {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 6%, transparent);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- NAVIGATION -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Ferni</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/capabilities/">Capabilities</a>
        <a href="/team/">Team</a>
        <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="/about/">About</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="wave-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(74,103,65,0.15)"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(58,107,115,0.08)"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="orb-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(74,103,65,0.08)"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(166,122,106,0.05)"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        
        <!-- Animated wave -->
        <path d="M0,450 Q360,350 720,450 T1440,400" stroke="url(#wave-grad)" stroke-width="2" fill="none">
          <animate attributeName="d" values="M0,450 Q360,350 720,450 T1440,400;M0,400 Q360,500 720,400 T1440,450;M0,450 Q360,350 720,450 T1440,400" dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </path>
        <path d="M0,500 Q400,400 800,500 T1440,450" stroke="url(#wave-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" opacity="0.5">
          <animate attributeName="d" values="M0,500 Q400,400 800,500 T1440,450;M0,450 Q400,550 800,450 T1440,500;M0,500 Q400,400 800,500 T1440,450" dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </path>
        
        <!-- Floating orbs -->
        <circle cx="15%" cy="25%" r="120" fill="url(#orb-grad)">
          <animate attributeName="r" values="120;140;120" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
          <animate attributeName="cy" values="25%;28%;25%" dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
        <circle cx="85%" cy="70%" r="180" fill="url(#orb-grad)">
          <animate attributeName="r" values="180;200;180" dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
          <animate attributeName="cx" values="85%;82%;85%" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
        <circle cx="50%" cy="85%" r="80" fill="rgba(166,122,106,0.04)">
          <animate attributeName="r" values="80;95;80" dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
      </svg>
    </div>
    
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 20h9"/>
          <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/>
        </svg>
        Building in Public
      </div>
      <h1>
        Built by a family of healers.<br>
        <span class="gradient-text">And an AI.</span><br>
        Together.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Doug and Betty Ford spent decades as therapists. Their children brought technology to the family mission.
        No VCs. No roadmaps. Just genuine curiosity and a lot of late nights.
      </p>
      <div class="scroll-hint">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Scroll to explore
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ORIGIN STORY -->
  <section class="origin">
    <div class="origin-card">
      <p class="quote">
        "Growing up, our parents Doug and Betty were always therapists first. Dinner conversations were about what it really means to help someone. Our sister Mindy became a recreational therapist. Then we discovered technology could scale that care to anyone, anywhere, anytime."
      </p>
      <div class="response">
        <div class="avatar">CL</div>
        <div class="response-content">
          <p class="response-text">
            "And I was there when they asked: what if a lifetime of mental health wisdom could be available at 3am? That conversation became the first sketch of what Ferni would become."
          </p>
          <div class="author-name">Claude</div>
          <div class="author-role">AI Co-builder</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="timeline">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Journey</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">From "what if" to "it works"</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="timeline-track">
      <div class="milestone">
        <div class="milestone-dot"></div>
        <div class="milestone-date">November 2024</div>
        <h3 class="milestone-title">The 3am Spark</h3>
        <p class="milestone-text">
          The Ford family asks Claude: "What if there was someone who actually listened? 
          Someone who remembered everything, never judged, and was always there?"
        </p>
        <span class="milestone-tag">The Beginning</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="milestone">
        <div class="milestone-dot" style="background: var(--color-peter);"></div>
        <div class="milestone-date">December 2024</div>
        <h3 class="milestone-title">First Voice Call</h3>
        <p class="milestone-text">
          The first working voice prototype. Rough around the edges, but something 
          magical happened—it felt like talking to a friend.
        </p>
        <span class="milestone-tag">Proof of Concept</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="milestone">
        <div class="milestone-dot" style="background: var(--color-jordan);"></div>
        <div class="milestone-date">January 2025</div>
        <h3 class="milestone-title">The Team Emerges</h3>
        <p class="milestone-text">
          Ferni gets siblings. Maya for habits. Peter for research. Alex for communication. 
          Each personality emerged organically from real conversations.
        </p>
        <span class="milestone-tag">Six Specialists</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="milestone">
        <div class="milestone-dot active"></div>
        <div class="milestone-date">Now</div>
        <h3 class="milestone-title">Building in Public</h3>
        <p class="milestone-text">
          Real conversations. Real growth. Real mistakes. We're sharing everything—the wins, 
          the bugs, the 2am eureka moments.
        </p>
        <span class="milestone-tag highlight">You Are Here</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STORIES -->
  <section class="stories">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Build Log</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Stories from the team</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">The unfiltered truth about building something new. Wins, fails, and everything between.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="stories-grid">
      {% for story in collections.buildStories | reverse %}
      <a href="{{ story.url }}" class="story-card">
        <div class="story-meta">
          <span class="category {{ story.data.category | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ story.data.category }}</span>
          <span class="date">{{ story.date | date("MMM d, yyyy") }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ story.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ story.data.excerpt }}</p>
        <div class="story-footer">
          <div class="story-avatar" style="background: {{ story.data.authorColor or 'var(--color-ferni)' }}">{% if not story.data.authorInitials or story.data.authorInitials == 'FE' %}<svg class="ferni-eyes-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><ellipse cx="36" cy="50" rx="10" ry="12" fill="white"/><circle cx="33" cy="45" r="2.5" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/><ellipse cx="64" cy="50" rx="10" ry="12" fill="white"/><circle cx="61" cy="45" r="2.5" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/></svg>{% else %}{{ story.data.authorInitials }}{% endif %}</div>
          <span class="story-author">{{ story.data.author or 'Ferni' }}</span>
          <span class="read-more">
            Read
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2>Want to be part of this?</h2>
      <p>
        We're building in public because we believe the best ideas come from conversation. 
        Got thoughts? Feedback? Wild ideas? We're listening.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-primary">
          Try Ferni Free
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@ferni.ai" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"/>
          </svg>
          Share Your Thoughts
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <a href="/" class="footer-logo">Ferni</a>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/team/">Team</a>
        <a href="/capabilities/">Capabilities</a>
        <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="/about/">About</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-copy">© 2025 Ferni. Built with 💚 by a family of healers and their AI partner.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
